# Commercially-licensed font faces — NOT redistributable via this repo.
#
# Optima (commercial, Linotype) and Joe Hand: web-embedding rights unconfirmed as of
# 2026-08-12, and this repo was public when they were first pushed. They are delivered by
# the build/deploy pipeline instead of being committed. → LS-2012
#
# ⚠️ theme.json still registers these faces, so a fresh clone has 4 unresolved @font-face
# rules until the pipeline supplies the files. Headings fall back to Belleza (bundled) and
# then sans-serif — degraded, not broken.
#
# ⚠️ These patterns do not remove the files already in git history. If this repo is ever
# public again, history needs rewriting.
#
# The OFL faces (Open Sans, Belleza, La Belle Aurore) are committed and safe to ship.
assets/fonts/optima-*.woff2
assets/fonts/joe-hand-*.woff2

# Test artefacts
tests/**/test-results/
tests/**/playwright-report/
tests/**/node_modules/
